{
  "sn7.22:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 7.22 ",
  "sn7.22:0.2": "2. Upāsakavagga ",
  "sn7.22:0.3": "Khomadussasutta ",
  "sn7.22:1.1": "Evaṁ me sutaṁ—",
  "sn7.22:1.2": "ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā sakkesu viharati khomadussaṁ nāmaṁ sakyānaṁ nigamo. ",
  "sn7.22:1.3": "Atha kho bhagavā pubbaṇhasamayaṁ nivāsetvā pattacīvaramādāya khomadussaṁ nigamaṁ piṇḍāya pāvisi. ",
  "sn7.22:1.4": "Tena kho pana samayena khomadussakā brāhmaṇagahapatikā sabhāyaṁ sannipatitā honti kenacideva karaṇīyena, devo ca ekamekaṁ phusāyati. ",
  "sn7.22:1.5": "Atha kho bhagavā yena sā sabhā tenupasaṅkami. ",
  "sn7.22:1.6": "Addasaṁsu khomadussakā brāhmaṇagahapatikā bhagavantaṁ dūratova āgacchantaṁ. ",
  "sn7.22:1.7": "Disvāna etadavocuṁ: ",
  "sn7.22:1.8": "“ke ca muṇḍakā samaṇakā, ke ca sabhādhammaṁ jānissantī”ti? ",
  "sn7.22:1.9": "Atha kho bhagavā khomadussake brāhmaṇagahapatike gāthāya ajjhabhāsi: ",
  "sn7.22:2.1": "“Nesā sabhā yattha na santi santo, ",
  "sn7.22:2.2": "Santo na te ye na vadanti dhammaṁ; ",
  "sn7.22:2.3": "Rāgañca dosañca pahāya mohaṁ, ",
  "sn7.22:2.4": "Dhammaṁ vadantā ca bhavanti santo”ti. ",
  "sn7.22:3.1": "Evaṁ vutte, khomadussakā brāhmaṇagahapatikā bhagavantaṁ etadavocuṁ: ",
  "sn7.22:3.2": "“abhikkantaṁ, bho gotama, abhikkantaṁ, bho gotama. ",
  "sn7.22:3.3": "Seyyathāpi, bho gotama, nikkujjitaṁ vā ukkujjeyya, paṭicchannaṁ vā vivareyya, mūḷhassa vā maggaṁ ācikkheyya